<li>Histrionicus histrionicus / Harlequin duck</li>
<li>Lepus brachyurus / Japanese hare</li>
<li>Macaca fuscata / Japanese macaque</li>
<li>Martes melampus / Japanese martem</li>
<li>Mustela erminea / Ermine</li>
<li>Mustela sibirica / Pulusan Siberian</li>
<li>Nisaetus nipalensis / Mountain hawk eagle</li>
